# Convex Dashboard env (Settings → Environment variables): set CLERK_JWT_ISSUER_DOMAIN = base of your Clerk JWKS URL (strip /.well-known/jwks.json). E.g. if JWKS URL is https://useful-oryx-4.clerk.accounts.dev/.well-known/jwks.json then use https://useful-oryx-4.clerk.accounts.dev
